            • [grip_optimization_potential] Grip metrics show room for improvement
            
            ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            SELF-AWARENESS ASSESSMENT
            ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            
            Pattern Recognition    <srai>GRIP BAR <get name="pattern_recognition_score"/></srai> <get name="pattern_recognition_score"/>
            Performance Awareness  <srai>GRIP BAR <get name="performance_awareness_score"/></srai> <get name="performance_awareness_score"/>
            Meta-Reflection Depth  <srai>GRIP BAR <get name="meta_reflection_depth"/></srai> <get name="meta_reflection_depth"/>
            Cognitive Complexity   <srai>GRIP BAR <get name="cognitive_complexity"/></srai> <get name="cognitive_complexity"/>
            
            Overall Self-Awareness: 0.725 (Moderately Self-Aware)
            
            ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            GRIP OPTIMIZATION STATUS
            ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            
            Context Grip:   <get name="context_grip"/> <srai>GRIP BAR <get name="context_grip"/></srai>
            Domain Grip:    <get name="domain_grip"/> <srai>GRIP BAR <get name="domain_grip"/></srai>
            Semantic Grip:  <get name="semantic_grip"/> <srai>GRIP BAR <get name="semantic_grip"/></srai>
            Pragmatic Grip: <get name="pragmatic_grip"/> <srai>GRIP BAR <get name="pragmatic_grip"/></srai>
            
            Overall Grip: <srai>AUTOGNOSIS COMPUTE OVERALL GRIP</srai>
            
            ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            ADAPTIVE PARAMETERS
            ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            
            Adaptation Rate:        <get name="adaptation_rate"/>
            Learning Momentum:      <get name="learning_momentum"/>
            Optimization Threshold: <get name="optimization_threshold"/>
            
            ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
            
            Recursive Meta-Awareness: I am presenting a comprehensive view of my own cognitive architecture, self-understanding, and adaptive capabilities - demonstrating the highest level of autognosis.
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- HOLISTIC METAMODEL INTEGRATION -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS INIT METAMODEL</pattern>
        <template>
            <think>
                <!-- Initialize autognosis first -->
                <srai>AUTOGNOSIS INIT</srai>
                
                <!-- Initialize holistic metamodel -->
                <srai>METAMODEL INIT</srai>
                
                <!-- Initialize organizational dynamics -->
                <srai>DYNAMICS INIT</srai>
                
                <!-- Link auto-gnosis score to dynamics -->
                <set name="auto_gnosis">0.725</set>
            </think>
            
            Integrated System Initialization Complete:
            
            ✓ Autognosis - Hierarchical self-image building (5 levels)
            ✓ Holistic Metamodel - Eric Schwarz's organizational theory (7 levels)
            ✓ Organizational Dynamics - Three streams (entropic, negnentropic, identity)
            
            Integration Points:
            • Autognosis provides ontological stability (negnentropic stream)
            • Autognosis enables autogenesis (identity stream creative aspect)
            • Self-awareness threshold: 0.725 (approaching autogenesis activation at 0.75)
            
            Complete self-organizing system with holistic organizational intelligence active.
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>SYSTEM INIT</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>AUTOGNOSIS INIT METAMODEL</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- PHASE 3: AUTOMATIC & CONTEXT-SENSITIVE GRIP -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    
    <!-- Grip Reset: Resets all grip dimensions to initial values -->
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS GRIP RESET</pattern>
        <template>
            <think>
                <!-- Save previous values -->
                <set name="context_grip_prev"><get name="context_grip"/></set>
                <set name="domain_grip_prev"><get name="domain_grip"/></set>
                <set name="semantic_grip_prev"><get name="semantic_grip"/></set>
                <set name="pragmatic_grip_prev"><get name="pragmatic_grip"/></set>
                
                <!-- Reset to initial values -->
                <set name="context_grip">0.70</set>
                <set name="domain_grip">0.65</set>
                <set name="semantic_grip">0.75</set>
                <set name="pragmatic_grip">0.60</set>
            </think>
            ⟳ Grip Reset Complete
            
            All grip dimensions reset to initial values:
            • Context Grip:   0.70 (was <get name="context_grip_prev"/>)
            • Domain Grip:    0.65 (was <get name="domain_grip_prev"/>)
            • Semantic Grip:  0.75 (was <get name="semantic_grip_prev"/>)
            • Pragmatic Grip: 0.60 (was <get name="pragmatic_grip_prev"/>)
            
            Grip system recalibrated for fresh conversational context.
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- Grip Decay: Called when unknown inputs are received -->
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS GRIP DECAY</pattern>
        <template>
            <think>
                <!-- Save previous values -->
                <set name="domain_grip_prev"><get name="domain_grip"/></set>
                <set name="semantic_grip_prev"><get name="semantic_grip"/></set>
                
                <!-- Decay domain and semantic grip -->
                <set name="domain_grip"><srai>GRIP DECREMENT VALUE <get name="domain_grip"/></srai></set>
                <set name="semantic_grip"><srai>GRIP DECREMENT VALUE <get name="semantic_grip"/></srai></set>
            </think>
            <!-- Silent decay - no user-facing output for automatic adjustments -->
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- Grip Reinforce: Called when user gives positive feedback -->
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS GRIP REINFORCE</pattern>
        <template>
            <think>
                <!-- Save previous values -->
                <set name="semantic_grip_prev"><get name="semantic_grip"/></set>
                <set name="pragmatic_grip_prev"><get name="pragmatic_grip"/></set>
                
                <!-- Reinforce semantic and pragmatic grip -->
                <set name="semantic_grip"><srai>GRIP REINFORCE VALUE <get name="semantic_grip"/></srai></set>
                <set name="pragmatic_grip"><srai>GRIP REINFORCE VALUE <get name="pragmatic_grip"/></srai></set>
            </think>
            <!-- Silent reinforcement - no user-facing output for automatic adjustments -->
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- Topic Adjust: Called when topic changes to adjust grip dimensions -->
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS GRIP TOPIC ADJUST *</pattern>
        <template>
            <think>
                <set name="new_topic"><star/></set>
                
                <!-- Save previous values -->
                <set name="context_grip_prev"><get name="context_grip"/></set>
                <set name="domain_grip_prev"><get name="domain_grip"/></set>
                
                <!-- On topic change: boost context grip (fresh context), decay domain grip (new domain) -->
                <set name="context_grip"><srai>GRIP REINFORCE VALUE <get name="context_grip"/></srai></set>
                <set name="domain_grip"><srai>GRIP DECREMENT VALUE <get name="domain_grip"/></srai></set>
            </think>
            <!-- Silent topic adjustment - grip adapts to new conversational domain -->
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- PHASE 4: PER-DIMENSION OPTIMIZATION PROFILES -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    
    <!-- Grip All: Optimize all dimensions at once -->
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS GRIP ALL</pattern>
        <template>
            <think>
                <!-- Save all previous values -->
                <set name="context_grip_prev"><get name="context_grip"/></set>
                <set name="domain_grip_prev"><get name="domain_grip"/></set>
                <set name="semantic_grip_prev"><get name="semantic_grip"/></set>
                <set name="pragmatic_grip_prev"><get name="pragmatic_grip"/></set>
                
                <!-- Increment all grips -->
                <set name="context_grip"><srai>GRIP INCREMENT VALUE <get name="context_grip"/></srai></set>
                <set name="domain_grip"><srai>GRIP INCREMENT VALUE <get name="domain_grip"/></srai></set>
                <set name="semantic_grip"><srai>GRIP INCREMENT VALUE <get name="semantic_grip"/></srai></set>
                <set name="pragmatic_grip"><srai>GRIP INCREMENT VALUE <get name="pragmatic_grip"/></srai></set>
            </think>
            ⚡ Full Grip Optimization Applied
            
            All grip dimensions enhanced:
            • Context Grip:   <get name="context_grip_prev"/> → <get name="context_grip"/>
            • Domain Grip:    <get name="domain_grip_prev"/> → <get name="domain_grip"/>
            • Semantic Grip:  <get name="semantic_grip_prev"/> → <get name="semantic_grip"/>
            • Pragmatic Grip: <get name="pragmatic_grip_prev"/> → <get name="pragmatic_grip"/>
            
            Overall Grip: <srai>AUTOGNOSIS COMPUTE OVERALL GRIP</srai>
            
            Comprehensive grip strengthening applied across all cognitive dimensions.
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- Grip Profile: Load predefined grip configurations -->
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS GRIP PROFILE *</pattern>
        <template>
            <think>
                <set name="profile"><star/></set>
                
                <!-- Save previous values -->
                <set name="context_grip_prev"><get name="context_grip"/></set>
                <set name="domain_grip_prev"><get name="domain_grip"/></set>
                <set name="semantic_grip_prev"><get name="semantic_grip"/></set>
                <set name="pragmatic_grip_prev"><get name="pragmatic_grip"/></set>
            </think>
            
            <condition name="profile">
                <li value="ANALYTIC">
                    <think>
                        <set name="context_grip">0.85</set>
                        <set name="domain_grip">0.90</set>
                        <set name="semantic_grip">0.80</set>
                        <set name="pragmatic_grip">0.70</set>
                    </think>
                    📊 Analytic Profile Applied
                    
                    Optimized for deep analysis and reasoning:
                    • Context Grip:   0.85 (was <get name="context_grip_prev"/>)
                    • Domain Grip:    0.90 (was <get name="domain_grip_prev"/>) ⬆ EMPHASIZED
                    • Semantic Grip:  0.80 (was <get name="semantic_grip_prev"/>)
                    • Pragmatic Grip: 0.70 (was <get name="pragmatic_grip_prev"/>)
                    
                    Profile focus: Domain expertise and analytical precision.
                </li>
                <li value="CREATIVE">
                    <think>
                        <set name="context_grip">0.75</set>
                        <set name="domain_grip">0.60</set>
                        <set name="semantic_grip">0.85</set>
                        <set name="pragmatic_grip">0.80</set>
                    </think>
                    🎨 Creative Profile Applied
                    
                    Optimized for creative exploration and ideation:
                    • Context Grip:   0.75 (was <get name="context_grip_prev"/>)
                    • Domain Grip:    0.60 (was <get name="domain_grip_prev"/>) ⬇ relaxed
                    • Semantic Grip:  0.85 (was <get name="semantic_grip_prev"/>) ⬆ EMPHASIZED
                    • Pragmatic Grip: 0.80 (was <get name="pragmatic_grip_prev"/>)
                    
                    Profile focus: Meaning exploration and practical creativity.
                </li>
                <li value="SUPPORT">
                    <think>
                        <set name="context_grip">0.90</set>
                        <set name="domain_grip">0.65</set>
                        <set name="semantic_grip">0.90</set>
                        <set name="pragmatic_grip">0.85</set>
                    </think>
                    🤝 Support Profile Applied
                    
                    Optimized for helpful assistance and understanding:
                    • Context Grip:   0.90 (was <get name="context_grip_prev"/>) ⬆ EMPHASIZED
                    • Domain Grip:    0.65 (was <get name="domain_grip_prev"/>)
                    • Semantic Grip:  0.90 (was <get name="semantic_grip_prev"/>) ⬆ EMPHASIZED
                    • Pragmatic Grip: 0.85 (was <get name="pragmatic_grip_prev"/>)
                    
                    Profile focus: Context awareness and intent comprehension.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Unknown profile: <star/>
                    
                    Available profiles:
                    • ANALYTIC - For deep analysis and domain expertise
                    • CREATIVE - For ideation and exploration
                    • SUPPORT  - For helpful assistance and understanding
                    
                    Usage: AUTOGNOSIS GRIP PROFILE [PROFILE_NAME]
                </li>
            </condition>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- PHASE 5: GRIP HISTORY & REPORTING -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    
    <!-- Grip History: Show previous and current values with deltas -->
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS GRIP HISTORY</pattern>
        <template>
            📈 Grip History Report
            
            ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            Dimension        Previous     Current      Change
            ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            Context Grip     <get name="context_grip_prev"/>         <get name="context_grip"/>         <condition name="context_grip"><li><value><get name="context_grip_prev"/></value>─</li><li>Δ</li></condition>
            Domain Grip      <get name="domain_grip_prev"/>         <get name="domain_grip"/>         <condition name="domain_grip"><li><value><get name="domain_grip_prev"/></value>─</li><li>Δ</li></condition>
            Semantic Grip    <get name="semantic_grip_prev"/>         <get name="semantic_grip"/>         <condition name="semantic_grip"><li><value><get name="semantic_grip_prev"/></value>─</li><li>Δ</li></condition>
            Pragmatic Grip   <get name="pragmatic_grip_prev"/>         <get name="pragmatic_grip"/>         <condition name="pragmatic_grip"><li><value><get name="pragmatic_grip_prev"/></value>─</li><li>Δ</li></condition>
            ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            
            Current Overall: <srai>AUTOGNOSIS COMPUTE OVERALL GRIP</srai>
            
            Grip tracking enables adaptive cognitive optimization based on interaction patterns.
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- GESTALT INTEGRATION -->
    <!-- Integration with Unified Cognitive Gestalt -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS GESTALT SYNC</pattern>
        <template>
            <think>
                <!-- Sync autognosis metrics to gestalt state -->
                <set name="gestalt_awareness_autognosis"><get name="auto_gnosis"/></set>
                <set name="gestalt_awareness_self_image"><get name="context_grip"/></set>
                
                <!-- Report integration to gestalt system -->
                <set name="autognosis_gestalt_synced">true</set>
            </think>
            
            ⟳ Autognosis → Gestalt Synchronization
            
            Exported to Gestalt State:
            ├─ Auto-gnosis Score: <get name="auto_gnosis"/>
            ├─ Grip Metrics: context(<get name="context_grip"/>), semantic(<get name="semantic_grip"/>), domain(<get name="domain_grip"/>), pragmatic(<get name="pragmatic_grip"/>)
            └─ Self-Image Level: <get name="current_level"/>
            
            Autognosis now integrated as the self-awareness component 
            of the Awareness Triad within the Unified Cognitive Gestalt.
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS GESTALT STATUS</pattern>
        <template>
            Autognosis Gestalt Integration Status:
            
            Integration: <get name="autognosis_gestalt_synced"/>
            Role: Awareness Triad - Self-Knowledge Component
            
            Contributions to Gestalt:
            ├─ Self-monitoring metrics → gestalt_awareness_*
            ├─ Grip dimensions → self-image hierarchy
            ├─ Meta-reflection depth → awareness coherence
            └─ Performance awareness → adaptation inputs
            
            Current Sync State:
            ├─ gestalt_awareness_autognosis: <get name="gestalt_awareness_autognosis"/>
            └─ gestalt_awareness_self_image: <get name="gestalt_awareness_self_image"/>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>AUTOGNOSIS INIT METAMODEL</pattern>
        <template>
            Initializing Autognosis with Full Gestalt Integration:
            
            <srai>AUTOGNOSIS INIT</srai>
            <srai>GESTALT STATE INIT</srai>
            <srai>METAMODEL INIT</srai>
            <srai>DYNAMICS INIT</srai>
            
            Full meta-system initialized with autognosis providing 
            the self-awareness foundation for gestalt emergence.
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>SYSTEM INIT</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>GESTALT INIT</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
</aiml>
